flowchart TD
  goal[Read goal]:::start --> plan[Plan tasks]:::agent
  plan --> task[Do next task]:::agent
  task --> verify[Check result]:::agent
  verify --> fixed{passes}
  fixed -->|no, max 3| task
  fixed -->|yes| more{moreTasks}
  more -->|yes, max 20| task
  more -->|no| approve{{Final approval}}:::human
  approve -->|rejected, max 2| plan
  approve -->|approved| ship([Ship]):::stop
